# OS files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Editor / IDE (user-specific; shared workspace settings may be committed separately)
.idea/
*.suo
